<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Itau nine-month net 428 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Itau nine-month net 428 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian private bank Itau on Tuesday issued the following statement on its January-to-September results.</p>
<p>			  Jan-Sept 1996</p>
<p>    net profit		428 million</p>
<p>    net worth	     3.842 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
</text>
